From: Longwei Yang <19267252+Longwei-Yang@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 16:37:31 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 24/26] Safarium: History > Reopen All Windows from Last
 Session

Safarium shows no "Restore pages?" prompt after a crash (Chrome anchors
it to its app menu). Instead, as in Safari, History > Reopen All Windows
from Last Session restores the previous run's windows
(SessionRestore::RestoreSessionAfterCrash; a lone New Tab page is
replaced). It is available once per run, after a crash or a normal quit,
unless startup already reopened the last session. Before this there was
no way back to the tabs after a crash.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
